 "description": "Get the full source \u2192 finding \u2192 construct \u2192 survey-item evidence chain for one source by id (from list_evidence_sources): its citation, every finding extracted from it, the constructs derived from each finding, and the survey items derived from each construct. Same content rendered at performix.app/learn/evidence/<id>. HONESTY: the citation is exposed as-is, including the 132 sources still carrying a placeholder title (HO-2431) \u2014 `citationPlaceholder` says which.",
